    "name_raw": "Rapid Grappler",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Roleplaying Game Ultimate Combat",
    "definition_raw": "You are a quick hand at grappling.\n\nPrerequisite: Dex 13, Greater Grapple, Improved Grapple, Improved Unarmed Strike, base attack bonus +9 or monk level 9th.\n\nBenefit: Whenever you use Greater Grapple to successfully maintain a grapple as a move action, you can then spend a swift action to make a grapple combat maneuver check at a –5 penalty.",
